- Async/queue registrations checked: Examined `upload/server/src/bootstrap.ts` and `upload/server/src/services/ai-metadata-jobs.ts` for `strapi.cron.add`/`registerCron`; inferred remaining cron via `weeklyMetrics.registerCron`. Did not scan other plugins or global cron registrations.
