- Auth/cross-cutting behavior checked: Noted use of `admin::permission` manager and policy configs in `routes/admin.ts` and `admin-file.ts` but did not dive into their implementations.
- Runtime/framework wiring checked: Inspected upload plugin `bootstrap.ts` and `upload/server/src/utils/index.ts` service resolver; relied on general Strapi knowledge for when `bootstrap` is invoked. Did not inspect global plugin registration or DI container code.
- Tests checked: Read `upload/server/src/__tests__/bootstrap.test.ts` only. Did not check any other test files or suites.
- Unresolved areas: Did not verify whether any other part of the system deletes AI metadata jobs, how `aiMetadataService.processExistingFiles` updates job status, or how the admin frontend interprets the “latest job.” Did not explore other plugins or the core cron scheduler implementation.

